            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.38

- Finished sessions can clear themselves from the notch: Settings > General > Dynamic Island > Clear finished sessions removes them 30 seconds, a minute or five minutes after they finish. Never, the default, keeps them as before.
- Side A prefers Python 3.11 or later when one is installed, so the island can read Codex's `config.toml` and an administrator's requirements.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
